OL,3,ATrump welcomes Xi to White House and
OL,4,Asays he is 'proud' of US-China
OL,5,Arelationship
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says the US and China have
OL,8,Fmade "tremendous strides on the issues
OL,9,Ffacing our two countries" as he
OL,10,Fwelcomes Xi Jinping to the White House
OL,12,FTrump says the two leaders will discuss
OL,13,F"security, technology and super
OL,14,Fintelligence" - what the US president
OL,15,Fcalls artificial intelligence
OL,17,FBefore Xi arrived at the White House,
OL,18,FTrump again said he did not want more
OL,19,FAI regulation. "I want to leave it
OL,20,Fexactly where it is," he wrote online.
OL,21,F"That is China's position also"
